AI tools were used during the development of this project as a learning and development aid.

The AI was used to:

* Explain Python, OOP, and SQLite concepts.
* Help identify and troubleshoot programming errors.
* Provide guidance on project structure and database design.
* Review and suggest improvements to code.
* Assist with documentation and README preparation.

The project was developed, tested, and understood by the student, with AI assistance used as a support tool rather than as a replacement for the student's own learning and work.
